## Bundled in the package

### SCIP
Version: v0.10.0 (commit 1c2b6db7e560d5233c944f36e4ac1377cc6963fc), vendored from https://github.com/scip-code/scip/blob/v0.10.0/scip.proto byte for byte
Licence: Apache-2.0
Copyright: not stated in the licence file
Use: the SCIP index format, created by Sourcegraph: src/extract/scip/scip.proto is its protobuf schema, and hakutaku's decoder of index.scip is written from that schema

